        "original_id": "edce7867-73d0-5a7c-9fbd-54951dc42cb4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Rash, Patrick Dempsey, Amanda Peterson, Hayden Panettiere, Solange Knowles\n- Films: The Buddy Holly Story, Can't Buy Me Love, Queens Logic, Bring It On: All or Nothing\n- Roles: film director, producer\n- Topics: American films, teen romantic comedy, cheerleading comedy\n\nFacts:\n- Steve Rash is an American film director and producer.\n- Steve Rash is best known for directing The Buddy Holly Story, Can't Buy Me Love, and Queens Logic.\n- Can't Buy Me Love is a 1987 American teen romantic comedy film starring Patrick Dempsey and Amanda Peterson.\n- Can't Buy Me Love is about a nerd at a high school in Tucson, Arizona who pays a cheerleader $1,000 to pretend to be his girlfriend for a month.\n- Bring It On: All or Nothing was previously known as Bring It On Yet Again.\n- Bring It On: All or Nothing is a 2006 cheerleading comedy film directed by Steve Rash and starring Hayden Panettiere and Solange Knowles.",
